# Samples directory is read-only

`samples/metronic_vite_9.5.0` is a **read-only UI reference**.

## Forbidden

- Editing any file under `samples/`
- Importing from `samples/` in production apps
- Runtime dependency on `samples/` (path aliases, npm link, relative imports)
- Copying entire Metronic concept apps

## Allowed

- Reading sample source to understand AI Concept patterns
- Selectively porting/adapting AI Concept + traced shared UI into `apps/workspace_web`

## Do not port wholesale

CRM, Mail, Calendar, Todo, Real Estate, Store Inventory, and other non-AI Metronic concepts.

Upgrades: manual cherry-pick into `apps/workspace_web`; update `METRONIC_PORT.md`.
